# Arch dependency name -> Gentoo dependency atom.
# Used by bin/scaffold-ebuild and reviewed by hand when ebuilds are finished.
#
# Special values:
#   DROP            the dependency is part of Gentoo's @system / baseline
#                   toolchain (glibc, gcc-libs, coreutils, ...) and is omitted
#   MANUAL:<note>   no mechanical mapping; the ebuild must decide. Currently
#                   unresolved MANUAL entries are printed as warnings during
#                   scaffolding so they cannot be silently dropped.
#
# Keep entries sorted by Arch name. A versioned Arch dependency ("nodejs>=22")
# must either get its own literal entry here or it falls through to MANUAL.

